---
title: SSO (OIDC / SAML) + SCIM provisioning
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor U as User
  participant IdP as Identity provider
  participant W as apps/web (auth kernel)
  participant DB as Identity tables (admin conn)
  U->>W: login (email domain)
  W->>W: route domain to org SSO config
  W->>IdP: OIDC / SAML auth request
  IdP-->>W: assertion (verified)
  W->>DB: bind session to org membership
  Note over IdP,W: SCIM token (separate scope)
  IdP->>W: SCIM provision / deprovision
  W->>DB: sync memberships (org-isolated)
